推荐设计

创建 SDK 实例：

const sdk = new OverheatSDK({
  network: "sol-devnet"
})

或：

const sdk = new OverheatSDK({
  network: "evm-base-sepolia"
})

SDK 内部：

class OverheatSDK {

  readonly network: Network
  readonly config: NetworkConfig

  constructor(opts: { network?: Network }) {
    this.network = opts.network ?? DEFAULT_NETWORK
    this.config = NETWORK_CONFIGS[this.network]
  }

}

router 就变简单
async updateAnswer(
  signer: AnySigner,
  options: UpdateAnswerOptions
): Promise<string> {

  const { questionAddress, answer, explanation } = options

  if (this.network.startsWith("sol")) {

    const wallet = signer as anchor.Wallet

    const r = await sol.update_answer(
      questionAddress,
      answer,
      explanation,
      wallet,
      this.config
    )

    return r.transaction
  }

  if (this.network.startsWith("evm")) {

    const evmSigner = signer as EvmSigner

    const result = await evm.update_answer(
      evmSigner,
      questionAddress,
      answer,
      explanation,
      this.config
    )

    return result.txHash
  }

  throw new Error(`Unsupported network ${this.network}`)
}


用户使用方式（体验很好）
Solana
const sdk = new OverheatSDK({
  network: "sol-devnet"
})

await sdk.updateAnswer(wallet, {
  questionAddress,
  answer,
  explanation
})
EVM
const sdk = new OverheatSDK({
  network: "evm-base-sepolia"
})

await sdk.updateAnswer(signer, {
  questionAddress,
  answer,
  explanation
})